OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham abused
OL,4,Aposition - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Sheriff of Nottingham has
OL,7,Fbeen found to have abused his position
OL,8,Fto secure a discount of more than
OL,9,F#20,000 on repairs to his Land Rover,
OL,10,Fclaim gig tickets and receive free
OL,11,Fhospitality.
OL,13,FNottingham City Council Labour
OL,14,Fcouncillor Zafran Khan was found by an
OL,15,Fexternal investigation to have breached
OL,16,Fthe code of conduct.
OL,18,FKhan, who represents Wollaton West, is
OL,19,Fthe brother of the leader Neghat Khan.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
