OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham abused
OL,4,Aposition - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said he "denied any
OL,7,Fwrongdoing" and believed he "abided by
OL,8,Fthe rules as he genuinely understood
OL,9,Fthem to be".
